+		/////////////////////////////////////////////
+		// BunkerVR: point with a hand instead of looking with the camera.
+		// The VR mod answers through the camera: after setting a special roll value,
+		// reading the camera's matrix returns the hand's data instead. Without the
+		// mod installed the answer does not match, and the camera is used as normal.
